# Avisblue nvidia (NVIDIA open) — first-boot Flatpaks installed by
# avisblue-flatpak-manager (idempotent; version-hash gated).
#
# Gaming is universal across the fleet (VISION §5): Steam ships as a Flatpak,
# not an RPM stack, and is identical on main and nvidia. NVIDIA gets working
# acceleration from the open kernel modules in the base image.
#
# Modify this list and rebuild to change the first-boot Flatpak set.

# --- Gaming (Steam, universal) ---
com.valvesoftware.Steam
com.valvesoftware.Steam.Utility.MangoHud
com.valvesoftware.Steam.Utility.gamescope
net.davidotek.pupgui2
